flowchart LR
    browser["Browser: English questions, uploads, source viewer, SSE"]

    subgraph compose["Local Docker Compose"]
        api["FastAPI container<br/>UI, LangGraph, run lifecycle"]
        api -->|persistent stdio| mcp["MCP child in API container<br/>search_evidence / read_evidence / collect_scope<br/>read-only; no calculator"]
        api -->|run state, jobs, audit, events| pg[("PostgreSQL 17<br/>assistant DB: document partitions, HNSW + BM25, spans<br/>Langfuse DB: metadata")]
        mcp -->|repeatable-read, scoped role| pg
        worker["Worker container<br/>PDF/TXT parser, fixed + structural chunks"] -->|claim job; atomic publish, revision/counts| pg
        api -->|private upload bytes| files[("Private app_data volume")]
        files -->|original bytes| worker
        models[("Pinned local model cache<br/>E5 + MiniLM")]
        models -->|load E5 for passage embeddings| worker
        models -->|load E5 query model; V3 MiniLM reranker| mcp
        reconciler["Trace reconciler container"] -->|pending audit/trace state| pg
        lf["Langfuse web + worker"] -->|metadata| pg
        lf --> lfdeps["ClickHouse / Redis / MinIO"]
        api -->|trace observations and usage| lf
        reconciler -->|verify or retry trace delivery| lf
    end

    browser -->|same-origin HTTP| api
    api -->|authenticated HTTP, configured Codex provider| bridge["Host bridge on loopback"]
    bridge -->|restricted role/model and app-owned profile| cli["Host Codex CLI"]
    setup["One-off model-prepare"] -->|populate before normal runs| models
